{"type":"message","id":"49235c8c","parentId":"e7751f95","timestamp":"2026-03-28T14:53:16.131Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"PyAutoGUI is not available. Let me try to use the Windows API directly through PowerShell. I can use the `user32.dll` via Add-Type to simulate mouse clicks and keyboard presses.\n\nLet me write a PowerShell script to:\n1. Bring the WeChat window to the foreground\n2. Click on the search box\n3. Type \"433\"\n\nActually, I can try to use the `Win+C` hotkey to open WeChat search, or I can try to directly interact with the window.\n\nLet me try a simpler approach - use the `SendKeys` method via WScript.Shell to send keys to WeChat after bringing it to focus.\n\nFirst, let me try to bring the WeChat window to the foreground.","thinkingSignature":"7c1378821b87d8b2d8c2fd31b89c3b60fd8395214350171b766089654a4b013a"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qthkmvzkfk7k_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"Add-Type @\"\nusing System;\nusing System.Runtime.InteropServices;\npublic class WinAPI {\n    [DllImport(\"user32.dll\")]\n    public static extern bool SetForegroundWindow(IntPtr hWnd);\n    [DllImport(\"user32.dll\")]\n    public static extern bool ShowWindow(IntPtr hWnd, int nCmdShow);\n    [DllImport(\"user32.dll\")]\n    public static extern bool IsIconic(IntPtr hWnd);\n    [DllImport(\"user32.dll\")]\n    public static extern IntPtr FindWindow(string lpClassName, string lpWindowName);\n    public const int SW_RESTORE = 9;\n}\n\"@\n$hwnd = [WinAPI]::FindWindow(\"WeChatWindow\", $null)\nif ($hwnd -eq [IntPtr]::Zero) { $hwnd = [WinAPI]::FindWindow(\"WeixinWindow\", $null) }\nif ($hwnd -eq [IntPtr]::Zero) { $hwnd = [WinAPI]::FindWindow($null, \"微信\") }\nWrite-Host \"Found hwnd: $hwnd\"\nif ($hwnd -ne [IntPtr]::Zero) {\n    if ([WinAPI]::IsIconic($hwnd)) { [WinAPI]::ShowWindow($hwnd, 9) }\n    [WinAPI]::SetForegroundWindow($hwnd)\n    Write-Host \"Activated WeChat\"\n}","timeout":15}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":60199,"output":467,"cacheRead":21266,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":81932,"cost":{"input":0.018059699999999998,"output":0.0005604,"cacheRead":0.0012759599999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.019896059999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774709582820,"responseId":"06171e4ffdcd110a98e939ea071a99b0"}}
