{"type":"message","id":"066df5d9","parentId":"70d4fd2e","timestamp":"2026-03-28T14:53:34.481Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"WeChat is now activated. Now I need to click on the search box and type \"433\". Let me take a screenshot first to see where the search box is.Actually, I should use the WeChat search hotkey which is usually Ctrl+F. Let me send that key combination.","thinkingSignature":"eff09ee0c610e86554b082dc88570a379de1b7964244aac94b00e290b64e1232"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_mrpb32d1w6ye_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"Add-Type @\"\nusing System;\nusing System.Runtime.InteropServices;\npublic class Keyboard {\n    [DllImport(\"user32.dll\")]\n    public static extern void keybd_event(byte bVk, byte bScan, uint dwFlags, UIntPtr dwExtraInfo);\n    public const byte VK_CONTROL = 0x11;\n    public const byte VK_KEY_F = 0x46;\n    public const uint KEYEVENTF_KEYUP = 0x0002;\n}\n\"@\n# Press Ctrl+F for search\n[Keyboard]::keybd_event([Keyboard]::VK_CONTROL, 0, 0, [UIntPtr]::Zero)\n[Keyboard]::keybd_event([Keyboard]::VK_KEY_F, 0, 0, [UIntPtr]::Zero)\n[Keyboard]::keybd_event([Keyboard]::VK_KEY_F, 0, [Keyboard]::KEYEVENTF_KEYUP, [UIntPtr]::Zero)\n[Keyboard]::keybd_event([Keyboard]::VK_CONTROL, 0, [Keyboard]::KEYEVENTF_KEYUP, [UIntPtr]::Zero)\nWrite-Host \"Sent Ctrl+F\"","timeout":10}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":61014,"output":312,"cacheRead":21266,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":82592,"cost":{"input":0.0183042,"output":0.0003744,"cacheRead":0.0012759599999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01995456}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774709606196,"responseId":"06171e665896d4626aeb4a6698628129"}}
