{"type":"message","id":"e84f80ba","parentId":"58d3a60b","timestamp":"2026-03-28T14:53:43.582Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I sent Ctrl+F to open the search dialog. Now let me type \"433\" in the search box.","thinkingSignature":"ddd457454b93ae0b2d9b548863ad380f98f5a11f9646c5edbc9184e218fcde7e"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_r94dbyw73l3d_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"Add-Type @\"\nusing System;\nusing System.Runtime.InteropServices;\npublic class Keyboard {\n    [DllImport(\"user32.dll\")]\n    public static extern void keybd_event(byte bVk, byte bScan, uint dwFlags, UIntPtr dwExtraInfo);\n    [DllImport(\"user32.dll\")]\n    public static extern short VkKeyScan(char ch);\n    public const uint KEYEVENTF_KEYUP = 0x0002;\n    \n    public static void TypeChar(char c) {\n        short vk = VkKeyScan(c);\n        byte vkcode = (byte)(vk & 0xff);\n        byte shift = (byte)((vk >> 8) & 1);\n        if (shift == 1) {\n            keybd_event(0x10, 0, 0, [UIntPtr]::Zero); // Shift\n        }\n        keybd_event(vkcode, 0, 0, [UIntPtr]::Zero);\n        keybd_event(vkcode, 0, KEYEVENTF_KEYUP, [UIntPtr]::Zero);\n        if (shift == 1) {\n            keybd_event(0x10, 0, KEYEVENTF_KEYUP, [UIntPtr]::Zero);\n        }\n    }\n}\n\"@\n# Type \"433\"\n[Keyboard]::TypeChar('4')\n[Keyboard]::TypeChar('3')\n[Keyboard]::TypeChar('3')\nWrite-Host \"Typed 433\"","timeout":10}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":61345,"output":350,"cacheRead":21266,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":82961,"cost":{"input":0.0184035,"output":0.00041999999999999996,"cacheRead":0.0012759599999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02009946}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774709615404,"responseId":"06171e6fa591d2aaaecbe4fe6a641e12"}}
